      <h2>Kit Overview</h2>
      <p>The HTK-1006 Hand Tool Kit is the box of jigs that turns a Tormek water-cooled grinder into a knife, scissors, axe and short-tool sharpening station. This kit was bought in January 2026 bundled with the T-8 Original; everything about the machine itself &mdash; filling the trough, truing the stone with the TT-50, grading it coarse or fine with the SP-650, dressing the leather honing wheel, and reading the WM-200 AngleMaster &mdash; is covered on the <a href="/workshop/manuals/tormek-t8/">T-8 page</a> and is not repeated here. This page is about the jigs and, above all, the technique for each kind of blade they hold. The KS-123 Knife Angle Setter, bought separately from Lee Valley in May 2026, lives here too because it is used with the knife jigs.</p>
      <div class="figure">
